name: sim.persistentDataRead
description: Deprecated. See sim.readCustomBufferData instead.
luaSynopsis: bytes dataValue = sim.persistentDataRead(string dataTag)
pythonSynopsis: buffer dataValue = sim.persistentDataRead(string dataTag)
inputs:
1. dataTag: name of the data
outputs:
1. dataValue: value of the data, or None/nil if data does not exist. The returned data may contain any value, including embedded zeros.
replacedBy:
- name: getProperty, class: app, object_getProperty.method, note: "use a 'customData.'-prefix for the property name"
